{"unit_id":"IkariKr__dsh-orbit#card-zh","repo":"IkariKr/dsh-orbit","commit":"fa3677bf40500cc1657192e3c6412773e2330a9f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Orbit（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：为多台运行 DSH 的机器提供 Hub 与 Node 组成的远程访问和设备管理层。插件接入 DSH Settings，并注册本机状态接口；配套 Hub 维护节点注册信息、路由与管理界面，Node 主动连接 Hub。用户可通过端点选择器查看节点并打开可用节点，也可用设置面板生成二维码开始手机配对；项目还包含定时工作流和升级候选检查流程。适合需要从手机或浏览器访问多台自托管 DSH 的个人或小团队。部署需要 Node.js 22、SQLite、TLS 网关及 Hub/节点配置；不需要模型 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin/index.mjs:18-45","src/plugin/settings.mjs:18-55"]}
{"unit_id":"IkariKr__dsh-orbit#card-en","repo":"IkariKr/dsh-orbit","commit":"fa3677bf40500cc1657192e3c6412773e2330a9f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Orbit is a DSH plugin for remote access to multiple DSH machines. Its Settings panel supports QR phone pairing, and its Hub registers nodes and provides a browser selector. Nodes connect outbound to the Hub. Deployments need Node.js 22, SQLite, a TLS gateway, and Hub/Node configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin/index.mjs:18-45","src/plugin/settings.mjs:18-55"]}
